@startuml
title Sequence Diagram: Instansiasi RekeningBank dengan Delegasi Constructor

actor Caller as "Main"
participant Compact as "RekeningBank(String, String)"
participant Full as "RekeningBank(String, String, double)"

Caller -> Compact : new RekeningBank("111", "Ani")
activate Compact

note right of Compact: Constructor ringkas dipanggil\noleh Main

Compact -> Full : this("111", "Ani", 0)
activate Full

note right of Full: Delegasi ke constructor lengkap\n(this(...) adalah baris pertama)

Full -> Full : Validasi nomor & saldoAwal
Full -> Full : Inisialisasi: \nthis.nomor = "111"\nthis.pemilik = "Ani"\nthis.saldo = 0
Full -> Full : jumlahRekening++ (static)

Full --> Compact : selesai
deactivate Full

Compact --> Caller : referensi objek RekeningBank
deactivate Compact
@enduml